CHECK:BIT_MACRO: Prefer using the BIT macro
#326: FILE: arch/x86/include/uapi/asm/kvm.h:211:
+#define KVM_MSR_FILTER_DEFAULT_DENY  (1 << 0)

Defines like: 1 << <digit> could be BIT(digit).
